{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge and flap yourself out of danger. See what distance your penguin can reach while dodging various objects as well as sharks, birds and UFOs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of the game is to see what distance you can reach in metres. This requires jumping platforms and dodging obstacles and enemies such as trees, snowmen, birds, sharks etc. Collecting fish allows you to flap while airborne to facilitate dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting an obstacle or enemy, falling into the shark infested water or getting abducted by an UFO means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a randomly procedurally generated infinite runner so never repeats platform, obstacle/enemy positions or movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features coming soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2972330?t=1768857865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2972330?t=1768857865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972330/d3c15144fe1c9d43fe2c6756a3d8b1810c471e68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768857865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972330/d3c15144fe1c9d43fe2c6756a3d8b1810c471e68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768857865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge and flap yourself out of danger. See what distance your penguin can reach while dodging various objects as well as sharks, birds and UFOs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of the game is to see what distance you can reach in metres. This requires jumping platforms and dodging obstacles and enemies such as trees, snowmen, birds, sharks etc. Collecting fish allows you to flap while airborne to facilitate dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting an obstacle or enemy, falling into the shark infested water or getting abducted by an UFO means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a randomly procedurally generated infinite runner so never repeats platform, obstacle/enemy positions or movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features coming soon.</p>","developers":["Perpetuity Games Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972330/8bdeedf558c36ecc09b33e2f205a696abc5b78ec/header.jpg?t=1768857865","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2972330/1221823865/94b757c86c9677fbd818e36ebe8f13aab2a85929/1768314654/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768315341","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2972330/1221823865/94b757c86c9677fbd818e36ebe8f13aab2a85929/1768314654/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768315341","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2972330/1221823865/94b757c86c9677fbd818e36ebe8f13aab2a85929/1768314654/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768315341","id":257264149,"name":"Funky Rock Hoppers Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257264149/20b3e721720fd854443